            "review_title": "Review at The Mangrove Café Cooking Class",
            "review_text": "ivy b\n133 contributions\n2\nCooking class in the heart of nature.\nMay 2026 • Friends\nAn excellent morning to learn how to make the right Vietnamese dishes with mango salad, spring rolls, and also Banh Bot Loc. Everything was truly excellent. Thank you Tran for this authentic and unique experience in the heart of the lush countryside in the Otter Valley.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten September 3, 2026\nAnna\nCher Clients,\n\nMerci bien pour votre confiance en notre service. On tient a vous remercier d'avoir été chez The Mangrove Café Cooking Class\nLe cours de cuisine est la meilleure facon pour apprendre les bons plats de la cuisine locale. Au plaisir de vous reservir\n\nBien cordialement,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten September 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
