            "review_title": "Review at The Mangrove Café Cooking Class",
            "review_text": "Tina Ng\nHanoi, Vietnam140 contributions\n3\nAn excellent restaurant in the heart of nature\nJul 2026 • Friends\nCharming place on the promenade near nature. Only Western dishes (pizzas and pasta) are offered, the rest is entirely local and delicious! The dried beef and papaya salad was full of flavor, and the fried spring rolls and mandu were generously stuffed. We also had a smoothie and a lemongrass iced tea, a real treat!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 15, 2026\nAnna\nDear Nguyen,\n\nThank yo very much for being with us at the Mangrove!\nYour safisfaction the main key to keep us moving forward to the future\nWe wish you all the best in life\n\nBest regards,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nWritten August 16, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
