            "review_text": "Emma Miller\n1 contribution\n3\nWarm service and quality dishes\nApr 2026 • Family\nThe staff is always smiling and responsive. The menu is varied with many attractive options. I particularly liked the shrimp and fish dishes. A memorable experience.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten April 12, 2026\nAnna\nChers Clients,\n\nMerci bien pour votre choix chez nous. On est bien content que vous avez eu de belles expériences avec notre équipage pour apprendre la cuisine Vietnamienne. On tient à vous remercier votre confiance en notre prestation\n\nBien cordialement,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten April 14, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
