            "review_text": "jose f\n1 contribution\n5\nYou have to be serious about learning to cook.\nDec 2024 • Friends\nwe learned to cook with a funny Vietnamese chef, fresh ingredients and easy to prepare. mixing spices according to the recipe. you have to concentrate when learning to cook here. i was very serious and the result is the taste of the food i made is great.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 3, 2024\nkevint61\nHi Laura,\n\nWarmest greetings from The Mangrove Cooking Class!\nWe're very happy to know that you had a nice time learning new dishes at our organic restaurant. We're more than happy to have you as guest to lean vietnamese authentic cuisine. Once again, thank you very much for spending time with us\n\nBest regards,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
