            "review_text": "Cruiser43792097143\n1 contribution\n4\nLearn to cook in 2 hours\nDec 2024 • Couples\na fun place for tourists to learn cooking, a great place to keep memories of Cat Ba Island - Hai Phong! A short cooking course, where we were guided by the restaurant's chef, we were provided with fresh ingredients, marinated according to the recipe. It was great when the dish was finished!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 3, 2024\nkevint61\nDear valued guests,\n\nThanks for learbing with our chef Hong, this is the best way to get an excellent sight into Vietnamese cuisine. Wishing you all the best\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nWritten May 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
