            "review_text": "Jodie Barrows\n1 contribution\n4\nCooking is an art\nDec 2024 • Friends\nLearn to cook and enjoy the food you made, it's really fun. The three of us cooked the food together, from preparing the ingredients, pre-processing, seasoning, cooking and presenting the dish. It's not too difficult but requires meticulousness and following the right recipe. A great experience!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 2, 2024\nkevint61\nHi Laura,\n\nWarmest greetings from The Mangrove Cooking Class!\nWe're very excited to know that you had a nice time learning new dishes at our organic restaurant. We're more than happy to have you as guest to learn vietnamese authentic cuisine. Once again, thank you very much for spending time with us\n\nBest regards,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
