            "review_text": "Berry Torp\n1 contribution\n4\nLearn to make Hanoi spring rolls\nDec 2024 • Friends\nIt was difficult for me to choose to learn how to cook Hanoi fried spring rolls. There are many steps and many ingredients to prepare this dish. However, thanks to the enthusiastic and patient guidance of a good chef, I learned how to make this dish. The result I got was quite delicious. Thank you, teacher!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 2, 2024\nkevint61\nHi Laura,\n\nWarmest greetings from The Mangrove Cooking Class!\nWe're very glad to know that you had a nice time learning new dishes at our organic restaurant. We're more than happy to have you as guest to learn vietnamese authentic cuisine. Once again, thank you very much for spending time with us\n\nBest regards,\n\nAnna Nguyen\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
